' Train jdBasic - lesson 12: 12 | Higher-Order Functions | Functions as Data
' Chapter: The pipe operator
' Source: jdb/tv/scripts/script_12_higher_order.txt

DIM result = IOTA(10) |> FILTER(LAMBDA x -> x MOD 2 = 0, ?) |> SELECT(LAMBDA x -> x * x, ?) |> REDUCE(LAMBDA a, b -> a + b, ?)
PRINT "Sum of squares of even numbers from 1 to 10: "; result
